  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to overcome grievous injuries. As a Bonus Action, you can regain a number of hit points equal to half your hit point maximum.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest, unless you use 6 sorcery points to use it again.</p>",
